  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Times News Network\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                                Times News Network\n                                                                \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 4, 2026 at 01:55 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/chhatrapati+sambhajinagar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar</a>: Union minister of state for Ayush (independent charge) <a href=\"/tag/pratap+jadhav\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pratap Jadhav</a> on Tuesday called unnecessary use of antibiotics a major public health threat, urging <a href=\"/tag/pharmacists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">pharmacists</a> to take the lead in promoting the safe and <a href=\"/tag/rational+use+of+medicines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">rational use of medicines</a>.Addressing a state-level function organised by <a href=\"/tag/pharmacy+council+of+india+%28pci%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pharmacy Council of India (PCI)</a> in association with MGM University’s department of pharmaceutical sciences and Y B Chavan College of Pharmacy, Jadhav said every pharmacy should serve as a trusted centre for medicine-related information and awareness.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>“Antimicrobial resistance is not limited to a single patient. It is a challenge for the entire society,” he said, warning that self-medication, altering treatment without medical advice and discontinuing medicines midway fuel drug-resistant infections, making even common illnesses difficult to treat.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Highlighting the critical role of pharmacists in healthcare delivery, Jadhav said they must counsel patients on medicine quality, dosage, duration of treatment, method of use and possible side effects. He also urged pharmacists to encourage patients to complete prescribed courses and avoid sharing leftover medicines.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The minister said emerging fields like <a href=\"/tag/digital+health\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">digital health</a>, <a href=\"/tag/artificial+intelligence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">artificial intelligence</a>, biotechnology and drug research were creating new opportunities and stressed the need to update pharmacy education and training to keep pace with changing healthcare demands.PCI president Montukumar Patel said National Education Policy-aligned B Pharma curriculum now placed greater emphasis on clinical pharmacy, AI and advanced technologies. He said an industry-academia advisory board had been constituted to bridge the gap between education and industry requirements.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Patel said provisions of around Rs 200 crore had been made for <a href=\"/tag/gpat+scholarships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GPAT scholarships</a> for MPharma students, while Rs 80 crore has been earmarked for research and skill development centres.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Times News Network</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Times News Network</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 4, 2026 at 01:55 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 4, 2026 at 01:55 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHea